This local implementation adapts the mathematical statistical-equilibrium,
extinction and crossed-diagnostic algorithms of PyNeb by Valentina Luridiana,
Christophe Morisset and Richard A. Shaw. Original source version1.1.32 matches
the verified repository revision recorded in test/validation.md.
PyNeb is distributed under GNU GPL version3; see LICENSE.
Atomic radiative and effective collision data preserve the selected original
model values and their scientific source identifiers, listed in README and
test/validation.md. Original atomic text files with source citations are
retained in the private provenance archive.
Local adaptation removes the domain framework, file-format dependencies,
unrelated physical processes and other ions, while explicitly implementing
all mathematical stages required for the selected six-ion problem.
